@title Wire numbering window: the sample follows the fields (C-52)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Start 1, empty prefix, one digit: the sample next to the scheme reads 1, 2, 3, never 101, 102, 103.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "wire numbering"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Scheme"
expect "1, 2, 3"
expect_not "101, 102"
shot numbering-sample
check_layout
